To compile the New Rock compiler, run

	cc -o stdlib.o -c stdlib.c
	cc -o rockc rockc.c stdlib.o

The New Rock compiler reads from argument one as the
New Rock source code file to compile and argument
two as the include path. The include path specifies
the directory to search for files imported using the
include keyword - to compile the demo program, run

	./rockc demo.newrock . >demo.pebble
